-- Define the Car entity with its attributes and relationships
entity Car {
    -- Attributes
    engineType : string;
    color : string;

    -- Relationships
    hasLaneAssist : boolean;
    hasESP : boolean;
}

-- Define the Diesel engine type
entity DieselEngine {
    -- Attributes
    engineType : string;
}

-- Define the Gasoline engine type
entity GasolineEngine {
    -- Attributes
    engineType : string;
}

-- Define the Electric engine type
entity ElectricEngine {
    -- Attributes
    engineType : string;
}
```

In this UVL-Code:
- The `Car` entity includes attributes such as `engineType`, `color`, `hasLaneAssist`, and `hasESP`.
- Different types of engines (`DieselEngine`, `GasolineEngine`, and `ElectricEngine`) are defined separately.
- These entities represent the various components of a car and their relationships with each other.